// Spring and timing constants for Contract transitions. A demo names these instead of retyping
// numbers; the same constants as react-native-reanimated 4.x's `withSpring` and `withTiming`.

// The default spring: `-exact-spring(900, 120, 4)`.
// The default timing: 300 ms on a quadratic ease-in-out = cubic-bezier(0.455, 0.03, 0.515, 0.955).
// The older default spring (damping 10, mass 1, stiffness 100): `-exact-spring(100, 10, 1)`.
// A wiggly spring: `-exact-spring(900, 90, 4)`; a snappy one: `-exact-spring(900, 110, 4)`
// (the original also clamps overshoot, which Exact's spring does not do).

fn gentleSpring(): string = "-exact-spring(900, 120, 4)"
fn timingDefault(): string = "300ms cubic-bezier(0.455, 0.03, 0.515, 0.955)"
